<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Mipo 1996 net plunges into red.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Mipo 1996 net plunges into red.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in billions of won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net			   (loss) 4.9  vs   (gain) 5.9</p>
<p>    Profit/loss before tax  (loss) 4.9  vs   (gain) 8.5</p>
<p>    Turnover			   261.1  vs	  257.8</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>    in cash			    none   vs	  10</p>
<p>    Divident payment		  late March</p>
<p>NOTE - Hyundai Mipo Dockyard Co Ltd, an affiliate of the Hyundai Group,  repairs and reconstructs ships.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
